This product includes software from Humming (https://github.com/vllm-project/humming),
Copyright Humming contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
site/humming_include/humming/epilogue/gmem_writer.cuh is a modified copy of Humming's
include/humming/epilogue/gmem_writer.cuh (humming-kernels 0.1.20, as shipped in that image),
changed to fuse the expert activation and routing weight into the GEMM epilogue.

The Triton kernels in site/inkling_sm80_ops.py and site/inkling_sm80_moe_align.py and the
CUDA kernels in csrc/inkling_sm80_cuda.cu are written for this repository and reproduce the
behaviour of the corresponding vLLM operations.
